Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:27.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:33.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:33.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:40.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.11,0:18:40.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.87,0:18:46.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:46.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:53.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.55,0:18:53.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:58.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:58.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:19:01.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:01.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:07.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:07.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:11.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:11.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:15.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:15.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:20.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.95,0:19:20.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
